    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/autofac/Autofac/releases/tag/v9.3.3"&gt;v9.3.3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create AnyKey adapter registrations per registry by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/tillig/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/tillig"&gt;@tillig&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5464075629" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/autofac/Autofac/issues/1498" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/autofac/Autofac/pull/1498/hovercard" href="https://github.com/autofac/Autofac/pull/1498"&gt;#1498&lt;/a&gt; (fixes &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5460353032" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/autofac/Autofac/issues/1497" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/autofac/Autofac/issues/1497/hovercard" href="https://github.com/autofac/Autofac/issues/1497"&gt;#1497&lt;/a&gt;) - the &lt;code&gt;KeyedService.AnyKey&lt;/code&gt; fallback adapter was cached and handed to every registry that asked for it, so the first scope to receive it built and disposed its pipeline out from under the rest. Other scopes then failed to add middleware, resolved through a disposed activator, or adapted another scope's registration. Multitenant containers hit this most often.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix open generic multi-service registrations overriding later defaults by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/tillig/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/tillig"&gt;@tillig&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5466195764" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/autofac/Autofac/issues/1499" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/autofac/Autofac/pull/1499/hovercard" href="https://github.com/autofac/Autofac/pull/1499"&gt;#1499&lt;/a&gt; (fixes &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3332299681" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/autofac/Autofac/issues/1465" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/autofac/Autofac/issues/1465/hovercard" href="https://github.com/autofac/Autofac/issues/1465"&gt;#1465&lt;/a&gt;) - a registration source exposing one component for several open generic services applied it to all of them at once, landing it ahead of higher-priority sources those services had yet to query. Whichever service was resolved second got the shared component instead of its own overriding registration. Source priority rather than resolution order now decides the default; closed generic types were never affected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;System.Diagnostics.DiagnosticSource&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;Microsoft.Bcl.AsyncInterfaces&lt;/code&gt; (netstandard2.0 only) move to 10.0.12.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/autofac/Autofac/compare/v9.3.2...v9.3.3"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v9.3.2...v9.3.3&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
